Tables, unknown tags and arbitrary CSS remain visible literal markup.
-- input.html --
<h1>Fallbacks</h1>
<style>p { background: url(https://example.com/asset); }</style>
<table><tr><td>TABLE CONTENT</td></tr></table>
<p>Before <widget>UNKNOWN CONTENT</widget> after.</p>
